<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 7.385 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 7.385 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 7.385 billion pesos in the secondary market on Monday through five credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>1.597 bln  8 days</p>
<p>1.596 bln  7 days</p>
<p>1.596 bln  4 days</p>
<p>1.596 bln  3 days</p>
<p>1.000 bln  1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
